            <p style="font-size: var(--text-regular); line-height: var(--text-body-line-height); margin: 0px; text-wrap: pretty;">Every co-design cycle generates evidence about what AI should do in education, when it works, and why. We openly share our research findings, evaluation methods, and models for teaching and learning alongside AI, so the field can build from evidence instead of assumptions.</p>
